<LegalPage title="Refund Policy">
  <p>Because our products are digital and delivered instantly, please read the product description carefully before buying.</p>
  <h2>When we refund</h2>
  <ul>
    <li>The file is broken, corrupt or not as described, and we can't fix it within [X] days of you contacting us.</li>
    <li>You were charged twice for the same product.</li>
    <li>[ANY OTHER CASES, e.g. "within 14 days of purchase, no questions asked"]</li>
  </ul>
  <h2>How to ask</h2>
  <p>Email [CONTACT EMAIL] within [REFUND WINDOW] of purchase with your order number (it's in your receipt email). Approved refunds go back to your original payment method, usually within 5–10 business days.</p>
  <h2>After a refund</h2>
  <p>When a purchase is fully refunded, the product is removed from your Library and you agree to delete any copies you downloaded.</p>
  <p class="muted small">Note for EU/UK customers: by completing checkout you request immediate delivery and acknowledge that you lose your statutory right of withdrawal once the download is available. [CONFIRM WITH YOUR ADVISER]</p>
</LegalPage>
